content.text:
The external reference sites are currently timing out, so I won’t present unverified claims as research findings. The draft will clearly distinguish what the docket says, design recommendations, and assumptions that need expert testing.

The project will stay private while it is reviewed. I’m preparing:
- a submission-ready comment draft, but not filing it under Morgan’s name;
- an experimental schema and synthetic examples;
- a bounded review task for the volunteer data analyst;
- a realistic grant proposal and private HR disclosure draft.

